ind":"update","title":"Demo Update 3.0.4","summary":"A new demo update is now live: Localization - can now play in Russian, Japanese, Korean, and Simplified ChineseDifficulty - made Campaign Level 1 easierSeveral minor balance updates, bugfixes and polish improvements","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T20:07:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3495400-1840944183786490","game_id":"steam-3495400","kind":"announcement","title":"New Demo","summary":"This is a larger update that includes new features and improvements across the board: New FeaturesCampaignDemo campaigns can now be fully completed (you can play all 4 battles)Demo campaigns can now be played with Hideo (in addition to Soraya)The last two battles in a campaign are “boss” battles during which the opponent has a pre-placed cardCampaigns now have a single standard difficulty level as well as 5 additional higher levels for extra challenge that you can unlock in orderQuick BattlesAn ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T16:05:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786490","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3495400-1840310314349317","game_id":"steam-3495400","kind":"announcement","title":"Art Devlog - Lorenzo","summary":"We thought players might enjoy seeing how the new art is made, so our artist recorded a time lapse while painting the Lorenzo portrait.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T14:09:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314349317","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3495400-1835236783562126","game_id":"steam-3495400","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 3.0","summary":"Demo Update 3.0 This is a bigger update with several changes directly related to player feedback. Campaign Mode Major ChangesNow it matters how much you win a battle by.You begin with 20 VP at the start of the first battle. Half of what you win by carries over to the next battle (maximum 40).This replaces the old “Plague” passive that the opponent had.If you win by a lot, you get a bigger advantage for your next battle. If you barely win, your next battle will be more challenging. So this kind o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T01:37:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783562126","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3495400-1833334318564902","game_id":"steam-3495400","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updates","summary":"If you haven't tried the new Bannerlands Demo in a while, there have been several improvements over the past few weeks, especially related to visuals and polish.Several new card illustrations (as we continue to replace the old art)New VFX, animations, and sounds for various abilities as well as common actions like drafting cards, targeting, and end of battleSome balance/card changes, bugfixes and other quality of life improvements. More details in the Discord \"Updates\" channel: https://discord.g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-19T22:55:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318564902","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3495400-1832065502813782","game_id":"steam-3495400","kind":"announcement","title":"Art devlog: Diamond Mine","summary":"We thought players might enjoy seeing how the new art is made, so our artist recorded a time lapse while painting the Diamond Mine card today.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T01:50:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502813782","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3495400-1831432155566494","game_id":"steam-3495400","kind":"update","title":"April Art and Demo Update","summary":"There’s been a lot happening with Bannerlands over the last few months! New art, big design changes, and a new demo just in time for Steam Deckbuilders Fest 2026!Art OverhaulI am in the process of working with a new artist to replace all the art in the game. Thank you to https://www.workwithindies.com/, which helped me find several great candidates. I commissioned several test pieces from various arists and sent out a survey to players and got great feedback on the test pieces. (If you want to b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-29T23:11:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155566494","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3495400-1827626365766501","game_id":"steam-3495400","kind":"update","title":"New Art and Development Update","summary":"Work in progress exploration of colorsNew ArtI am happy to announce that entirely new art is currently being produced for the full game release. Work in progress explorations of TheophilusDesign ChangesI am also working on several improvements to the game. The entire meta-game is getting an overhaul and will be simplified and streamlined. There's also bug-fixing, quality of life improvements, polish, etc...I have temporarily taken down the demo since the game is changing enough that I don't feel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-24T18:04:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365766501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3495400-1815034432948556","game_id":"steam-3495400","kind":"announcement","title":"Bannerlands Demo Available Now","summary":"Today I released the free Steam demo of my civilization-themed strategy card game, Bannerlands. This limited content version of the game has enough gameplay to get a feel for the design, and I'm excited to hear what players think. Bannerlands is an ancient civilization roguelike deckbuilder, combining deeply strategic card battle mechanics with story-driven diplomacy. Write your history through procedurally-generated campaigns with hundreds of cards ranging from great pyramids and war elephants ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-01T21:32:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815034432948556","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3495400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3495400":"2026-10-26T10:38:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3495400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:36Z"},"4016230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38: